---
title: "get_sui_price (Pyth Sui Price Feeds: Use Real-Time Data)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_get_price: price_struct = pyth::get_price_no_older_than(price_info_object, clock, max_age=60)
    q_get_price --> q_extract_info: price_info = get_price_info_from_price_info_object(price_info_object)
    q_extract_info --> q_get_id: price_id = get_bytes(get_price_identifier(price_info))
    q_get_id --> q_check_id: assert price_id == testnet_sui_price_id
    q_check_id --> q_error: price_id != testnet_sui_price_id
    q_error --> [*]: abort E_INVALID_ID
    q_check_id --> q_extract_fields: price_id == testnet_sui_price_id
    q_extract_fields --> q_return: decimal = get_expo(price_struct), price_i64 = get_price(price_struct), timestamp = get_timestamp(price_struct)
    q_return --> [*]: return price_i64

    note right of q_get_price
        INV-001: price_struct must not be older than max_age (60 seconds)
        INV-002: get_price_no_older_than aborts if price is stale
    end note

    note right of q_check_id
        INV-003: price_id must match expected SUI/USD feed ID
        INV-004: E_INVALID_ID (code 1) raised on feed mismatch
    end note

    note right of q_extract_fields
        INV-005: price_i64, decimal, and timestamp are extracted but only price_i64 is returned
    end note
